{"1601570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Alters", "steam_appid": 1601570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3237520, 3237500], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/958d40105130f3dcabecbe683c463067.avif?t=1786355074\" width=780 height=936 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>crash-landed</strong> on a lethal, radiation-soaked planet, and you are running out of time. A scorching sun that burns everything in its path is coming your way. Your only hope of survival is a massive mobile base too complex for one person to operate. You are forced to make a decision no human has ever faced: <strong>creating a crew of alternative versions of yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But your solution may just become your biggest problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f48d67602ef9623e0a70dbd9fd6c6915.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f48d67602ef9623e0a70dbd9fd6c6915.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f48d67602ef9623e0a70dbd9fd6c6915.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You crashed. You are entirely alone. The sun is a death sentence, and your mobile base must keep moving to outrun it. With no rescue coming, you must find a way to operate it, or you’ll die. <br><br><strong>When the planet itself is your enemy, every second spent standing still brings you closer to ash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/996ad4cc462d759084e68aff4a685d0d.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/996ad4cc462d759084e68aff4a685d0d.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/996ad4cc462d759084e68aff4a685d0d.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must move. To move, you need help. Forced to use the base’s <strong>advanced quantum technology</strong> and the <strong>planet’s unique resources</strong>, you must create <strong>The Alters: alternative versions of yourself</strong>. Brought to life by a supercomputer that turned your alternative life choices into reality, they are your only hope. They bring the specific expertise and capable hands you drastically lack, <strong>but they also bring their own human baggage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/47dd1a120f20699b0c0ea4ff0e3556ec.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/47dd1a120f20699b0c0ea4ff0e3556ec.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/47dd1a120f20699b0c0ea4ff0e3556ec.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew of ‘yourselves’ is a psychological nightmare. Every Alter arrives with distinct personalities, memories, and regrets. You aren't just managing resources. You are also a relationship manager to yourself, mediating conflicts and confronting your past choices lightyears from home. <br><br>As tensions rise, your Alters will clash over how to handle the mission. <strong>Keep them sane and keep them together, or your own egos will destroy your only chance of seeing Earth again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f4216abcbe752d12f54907d429ec249b.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f4216abcbe752d12f54907d429ec249b.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f4216abcbe752d12f54907d429ec249b.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rolling base is your lifeline, your factory, and your home. Customize and upgrade it to accommodate your growing crew. Research cutting-edge technologies, manage crucial life-support gear, and manufacture what you need to survive. <strong>Turn your base into a self-sustaining powerhouse capable of keeping both your crew fed and your systems humming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/971e78c2365e07580abc7dfa79d56fc3.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/971e78c2365e07580abc7dfa79d56fc3.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/971e78c2365e07580abc7dfa79d56fc3.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot hide inside the hull forever. To fuel your base and progress your research, you must step out onto the hostile planet's surface. <strong>Venture out into unpredictable anomalies and heavy radiation to mine essential resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But watch the clock, as every expedition is a high-stakes gamble against the oncoming burning sunrise.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.poster.avif?t=1786355074\" width=960 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.webm?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/12fdc28eaa0ecf19ecaf1702ff2c63dc.mp4?t=1786355074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>crash-landed</strong> on a lethal, radiation-soaked planet, and you are runn